    "text": "The program plans balloons one at a time with a dynamic program. It never measures time, so the output is deterministic.\n\n**Approach**\n\n1. **Coverage gain.** For every turn and cell it keeps a gain value. The gain is the number of target cells that a balloon over that cell would cover and that no already-planned balloon covers at that turn. It starts as the plain count of targets within radius V. It is updated incrementally after each balloon is planned.\n\n2. **Per-balloon DP.** For each balloon, the DP runs backward over states (turn, cell, altitude), with altitude 0 meaning \"still on the ground at the start cell\". A move picks a new altitude in {a\u22121, a, a+1}, then the wind at that altitude carries the balloon. The move earns the gain of the cell it lands in. A move that pushes the balloon off the top or bottom row loses it and earns nothing further. The best path is then rebuilt forward from the start state.\n\n3. **Updating coverage.** After a path is fixed, each target it newly covers at turn t is marked covered. The gain of every cell around that target is then lowered for turn t.\n\n4. **Work limit.** The number of balloons planned this way is capped by a fixed work budget of about 4.5\u00b710\u2079 state updates. This keeps the run under 10 s without relying on timing. Balloons beyond the cap, or planned after no gain remains, launch in turn 1 and stay at altitude 1. Extra coverage can never lower the score.\n\n5. **Very large inputs.** If the state space is too big for the memory or time limits, every balloon uses the same launch-and-stay plan.\n\n**Validity.** Unlaunched balloons only output 0 or +1 for the launch. Launched balloons only move between altitudes 1 and A. Lost balloons output 0 for the rest of the turns, so their altitude stays legal.\n\n```cpp\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nstatic char buf[1<<25];\nsize_t bufLen=0,bufPos=0;\ninline int gc(){\n    if(bufPos==bufLen){bufLen=fread(buf,1,sizeof(buf),stdin);bufPos=0;if(bufLen==0)return -1;}\n    return buf[bufPos++];\n}\ninline long long readInt(){\n    int c=gc();while(c!='-'&&(c<'0'||c>'9')){if(c==-1)return 0;c=gc();}\n    bool neg=false;if(c=='-'){neg=true;c=gc();}\n    long long x=0;while(c>='0'&&c<='9'){x=x*10+(c-'0');c=gc();}\n    return neg?-x:x;\n}\n\nint R,C,A,L,V,B,T;\n\ntemplate<class F> void coverCells(int r,int c,F f){\n    for(int dr=-V;dr<=V;dr++){\n        int rr=r+dr; if(rr<0||rr>=R) continue;\n        int rem=V*V-dr*dr;\n        int w=(int)floor(sqrt((double)rem));\n        while((long long)(w+1)*(w+1)<=rem) w++;\n        while((long long)w*w>rem) w--;\n        if(2*w+1>=C){\n            for(int cc=0;cc<C;cc++){\n                int d=abs(cc-c); d=min(d,C-d);\n                if(d<=w) f(rr*C+cc);\n            }\n        } else {\n            for(int dc=-w;dc<=w;dc++){\n                int cc=((c+dc)%C+C)%C;\n                f(rr*C+cc);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nint main(){\n    R=readInt();C=readInt();A=readInt();\n    L=readInt();V=readInt();B=readInt();T=readInt();\n    int rs=readInt(),cs=readInt();\n    vector<int> tr(L),tc(L);\n    for(int i=0;i<L;i++){tr[i]=readInt();tc[i]=readInt();}\n    long long cells=(long long)R*C;\n    const double BUDGET=4.5e9;\n    long long perB=(long long)T*cells*A;\n    bool full = (long long)A*cells<=200000000LL && (long long)(T+1)*cells*A<=400000000LL\n        && (long long)T*cells<=400000000LL && (double)perB<=BUDGET;\n    vector<signed char> out((size_t)T*B,0);\n    int nDP=0;\n    if(full){\n        int N=(int)cells;\n        vector<int> mv((size_t)N*A);\n        for(int a=0;a<A;a++)for(int r=0;r<R;r++)for(int c=0;c<C;c++){\n            int dr=readInt(),dc=readInt();\n            int nr=r+dr; int id=r*C+c;\n            if(nr<0||nr>=R) mv[(size_t)id*A+a]=-1;\n            else mv[(size_t)id*A+a]=nr*C+(((c+dc)%C)+C)%C;\n        }\n        vector<int> tid(N,-1);\n        for(int i=0;i<L;i++) tid[tr[i]*C+tc[i]]=i;\n        vector<int> cnt(N,0);\n        for(int i=0;i<L;i++) coverCells(tr[i],tc[i],[&](int x){cnt[x]++;});\n        vector<int16_t> gain((size_t)T*N);\n        for(int t=0;t<T;t++) for(int x=0;x<N;x++) gain[(size_t)t*N+x]=(int16_t)cnt[x];\n        vector<uint8_t> covered((size_t)T*L,0);\n        vector<int> F((size_t)(T+1)*N*A,0);\n        vector<int> G(T+1,0);\n        long long maxDP=(long long)(BUDGET/(double)perB);\n        nDP=(int)min<long long>(B,maxDP);\n        int start=rs*C+cs;\n        vector<int> W(A);\n        vector<int> pos(T);\n        int planned=0;\n        for(int b=0;b<nDP;b++){\n            G[T]=0;\n            for(int t=T-1;t>=0;t--){\n                const int16_t* g=&gain[(size_t)t*N];\n                const int* Fn=&F[(size_t)(t+1)*N*A];\n                int* Fc=&F[(size_t)t*N*A];\n                int Ws=0;\n                for(int x=0;x<N;x++){\n                    const int* m=&mv[(size_t)x*A];\n                    for(int a=0;a<A;a++){\n                        int d=m[a];\n                        W[a]= d<0?0:(g[d]+Fn[(size_t)d*A+a]);\n                    }\n                    int* fc=Fc+(size_t)x*A;\n                    for(int a=0;a<A;a++){\n                        int v=W[a];\n                        if(a>0&&W[a-1]>v)v=W[a-1];\n                        if(a+1<A&&W[a+1]>v)v=W[a+1];\n                        fc[a]=v;\n                    }\n                    if(x==start) Ws=W[0];\n                }\n                G[t]=max(G[t+1],Ws);\n            }\n            if(G[0]<=0) break;\n            planned++;\n            // reconstruct\n            bool launched=false,lost=false; int cell=start,alt=0;\n            for(int t=0;t<T;t++){\n                pos[t]=-1;\n                const int16_t* g=&gain[(size_t)t*N];\n                const int* Fn=&F[(size_t)(t+1)*N*A];\n                int adj=0;\n                if(lost){adj=0;}\n                else if(!launched){\n                    int d=mv[(size_t)start*A+0];\n                    int w0= d<0?0:(g[d]+Fn[(size_t)d*A+0]);\n                    if(w0>G[t+1]){\n                        adj=1;launched=true;alt=0;\n                        if(d<0) lost=true; else {cell=d;pos[t]=d;}\n                    }\n                } else {\n                    int best=-1,ba=alt;\n                    for(int na=alt-1;na<=alt+1;na++){\n                        if(na<0||na>=A) continue;\n                        int d=mv[(size_t)cell*A+na];\n                        int w= d<0?0:(g[d]+Fn[(size_t)d*A+na]);\n                        if(w>best||(w==best&&na==alt)){best=w;ba=na;}\n                    }\n                    adj=ba-alt;alt=ba;\n                    int d=mv[(size_t)cell*A+alt];\n                    if(d<0) lost=true; else {cell=d;pos[t]=d;}\n                }\n                out[(size_t)t*B+b]=(signed char)adj;\n            }\n            // update coverage\n            for(int t=0;t<T;t++){\n                if(pos[t]<0) continue;\n                int pr=pos[t]/C,pc=pos[t]%C;\n                int16_t* g=&gain[(size_t)t*N];\n                uint8_t* cv=&covered[(size_t)t*L];\n                coverCells(pr,pc,[&](int x){\n                    int id=tid[x];\n                    if(id>=0&&!cv[id]){\n                        cv[id]=1;\n                        coverCells(tr[id],tc[id],[&](int y){g[y]--;});\n                    }\n                });\n            }\n        }\n        nDP=planned;\n    }\n    // fallback for remaining balloons: launch at turn 0, stay at altitude 1\n    for(int b=nDP;b<B;b++){\n        for(int t=0;t<T;t++) out[(size_t)t*B+b]=(t==0)?1:0;\n    }\n    string s; s.reserve((size_t)T*B*3+T);\n    for(int t=0;t<T;t++){\n        for(int b=0;b<B;b++){\n            if(b) s.push_back(' ');\n            int v=out[(size_t)t*B+b];\n            if(v<0){s.push_back('-');s.push_back('1');}\n            else s.push_back('0'+v);\n        }\n        s.push_back('\\n');\n    }\n    fwrite(s.data(),1,s.size(),stdout);\n    return 0;\n}\n```",
